    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Concatenates a list of tensors along <computeroutput>axis</computeroutput> (since opset 13). All input tensors must share the same data type and the same shape except along the concatenation axis. <computeroutput>axis</computeroutput> may be negative, in which case it counts from the back of the input rank. </para>
